        1   block-level on error undo, throw.
        2   define buffer bf_pl-gds-pump for ub.pl-gds-pump.
        3   do on error undo, return error return-value :
        4   for each bf_pl-gds-pump no-lock on error undo, return error return-value :
        5     run str/callnews.p
        6       (input "pl-gds-pump"
        7       ,input (buffer bf_pl-gds-pump:handle)
        8       ) .
        9   end.
       10   message "Вся таблица складское-место_товар_ТРК отправлена по новостям." view-as alert-box.
       11   end.
